<h2>Tonight's verdicts by agent</h2>
<div class="tw"><table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Agent</th><th>Installs</th><th>Passed</th><th>Needs an API key</th><th>Broken (2+ nights)</th><th>Pending re-check</th><th>Flaky</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for a in site.agents %}{% if r.by[a] %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ a|agentName }}</th><td>{{ r.by[a].total }}</td><td class="tok">{{ r.by[a].pass }}</td><td>{{ r.by[a].needs_key if r.by[a].needs_key != null else "–" }}</td><td>{{ r.by[a].broken if r.by[a].broken != null else "–" }}</td><td>{{ r.by[a].pending if r.by[a].pending != null else "–" }}</td><td>{{ r.by[a].flaky if r.by[a].flaky != null else "–" }}</td></tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<p class="muted">How to read this: <b>Needs an API key</b> means the add-on asked for a key or token our keyless sandbox doesn't have, so it's probably fine on your machine once you add yours. <b>Pending</b> failed tonight (after a retry) but worked last night; we only call it broken if it fails again tomorrow. <b>Flaky</b> flip-flopped lately or only passed on retry.</p>
{% if r.standout %}<h2>Standout pick</h2>
<p><a href="/skills/{{ r.standout.slug }}/"><b>{{ r.standout.name }}</b></a>{% if r.standout.why %} ({{ r.standout.why }}){% endif %}: installed cleanly in {{ r.standout.agents.length }} agents ({% for a in r.standout.agents %}{{ a|agentName }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}){% if r.standout.stars %}, {{ r.standout.stars | kfmt }} GitHub stars{% endif %}. {{ r.standout.desc }}</p>
<p class="muted">How we pick: clean in every agent we tested it in, nothing flaky or pending, new and really-fixed add-ons first, then GitHub stars. Never sponsored.</p>{% endif %}
{% if r.prev_date %}<h2>Confirmed broke ({{ r.broke.length }})</h2>{% if r.broke.length %}<ul>{% for x in r.broke %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>Nothing newly confirmed broken (failing two nights in a row after a good night).</p>{% endif %}
<h2>Really fixed ({{ r.fixed.length }})</h2>{% if r.fixed.length %}<ul>{% for x in r.fixed %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>Nothing came back after failing two or more nights.</p>{% endif %}
{% if r.pending_list and r.pending_list.length %}<h2>Pending re-check ({{ r.pending_list.length }})</h2><p>Failed tonight, worked last night. Not calling these broken yet.</p><ul>{% for x in r.pending_list %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% if r.flaky_list and r.flaky_list.length %}<h2>Flaky ({{ r.flaky_list.length }})</h2><p>These flip-flopped between pass and fail recently. They pass tonight, but give them a retry if one hiccups on you.</p><ul>{% for x in r.flaky_list %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if r.needs_key_list and r.needs_key_list.length %}<h2>Needs your API key ({{ r.needs_key_list.length }})</h2><p>Not broken, just shy without credentials. Our sandbox has no keys on purpose.</p><ul>{% for x in r.needs_key_list %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% if r.added.length %}<h2>New additions ({{ r.added.length }})</h2><ul>{% for x in r.added %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% if r.removed.length %}<h2>Dropped from the lists ({{ r.removed.length }})</h2><ul>{% for x in r.removed %}<li>{{ x.name }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% if r.broken_list and r.broken_list.length %}<details><summary><h2 style="display:inline">Everything failing 2+ nights ({{ r.broken_list.length }})</h2></summary><ul>{% for x in r.broken_list %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>{% endif %}
<h2>Agent versions tested</h2><ul>{% for a in site.agents %}{% if r.versions[a] %}<li>{{ a|agentName }}: <code>{{ r.versions[a] }}</code></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>
<p class="muted">Run started {{ r.run_at }}. Every failed install is retried once in a fresh sandbox before it counts. Each skill page has the log. <a href="/how-we-test/">How we test</a> · <a href="/reports/week/">Weekly scorecards</a> · <a href="/reports/">All daily reports</a></p>
